{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city under fire, it\u2019s up to Officer Faust and Officer Lo to clean up the streets. Play as Faust or Lo, or the rest of the police force, to breach-and-clear your way through over 23 hand-crafted missions as you are tasked with neutralizing hostile threats and rescuing civilians.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/e3c8a7738e33cc2985a1b505e447a132.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=988 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/e3c8a7738e33cc2985a1b505e447a132.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/e3c8a7738e33cc2985a1b505e447a132.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFast and Low\u201d is a violent and intense tactical shooter that is depicted within a colorful and cartoonish setting.  One of the <strong>key</strong> features of \u201cFast and Low\u201d is that it can be played both in VR, or entirely using traditional FPS mouse/keyboard controls. Whereas the VR player will be able to physically peek around corners, and blind-fire from safety, FPS players are in turn given a wider array of tools and equipment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/4b65aa16656efde3f8d21880eade0034.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=988 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/4b65aa16656efde3f8d21880eade0034.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/4b65aa16656efde3f8d21880eade0034.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can play through the missions <strong>Solo</strong> (with an AI partner), <strong>Local Asymmetric Multiplayer</strong> (1 VR Player + 1 FPS Player on the <u>same </u>PC), or engage in up to 4-player <strong>Online Multiplayer Co-op</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/76652bd21c5ddd01ee3b5fc35dc53042.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=1008 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/76652bd21c5ddd01ee3b5fc35dc53042.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/76652bd21c5ddd01ee3b5fc35dc53042.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and Low features location-based damage for both hostiles and civilians. Shoot a hostile in the arm to disarm them, or target their legs to cripple them\u2014making them far more likely to surrender!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/8c864f080a410182f4cbd4f697791a6b.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=1008 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/8c864f080a410182f4cbd4f697791a6b.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/8c864f080a410182f4cbd4f697791a6b.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Built from the ground up for room-scale Virtual Reality. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local Asymmetric Multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online Multiplayer for up to 4 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game offers multiple forms of <strong>Free-locomotion</strong> (arm-swinging or touch-pad locomotion) and <strong>Snap/Smooth</strong> Rotation options, and accessibility options like '<i>Left-handed</i>' modes and <i>Movement Comfort Vignettes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience realistic weapon handling in Fast and Low. Manually chamber rounds, rack slides, and handle each firearm the way they're meant to be used.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/b7edf5d84854598e8ae870db6a1bc482.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/b7edf5d84854598e8ae870db6a1bc482.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/b7edf5d84854598e8ae870db6a1bc482.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Unlockable Weapons,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 Handcrafted levels</strong> to Breach and Clear your way through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomized enemy/civilian spawns to make each deployment feel different!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> A game mode where you can replay unlocked missions and adjust the civilian/enemy density, modify your health pool, or experiment with slow motion in multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>Spectator Camera</strong>\u00a0to share high quality footage with others!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What was the vision for Fast and Low? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vision of Fast and Low was to create a violent, and engaging tactical shooter, set within a colorful cartoonish world.  This was meant to be a difficult game akin to the old-school \u201cSWAT\u201d or \u201cRainbow Six\u201d series. Enemies will be able to kill  players quickly within one or two bursts, but likewise, players can quickly dispatch targets with well-placed headshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon is also carefully crafted with its own unique recoil behaviour, making each firearm feel distinct and satisfying to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/6e600ca1371b88d3280e57db68d5b4b5.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/6e600ca1371b88d3280e57db68d5b4b5.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/6e600ca1371b88d3280e57db68d5b4b5.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>One of the <strong>KEY</strong> features of Fast and Low is its ability to allow VR players to play locally with a buddy (via <strong>Asymmetric Multiplayer</strong>) on the same computer. I felt that there weren\u2019t enough games currently in VR that allowed interaction between a VR player and the outside world.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who are the developers?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Just MYSELF! Fast and Low started off as a passion project which I was working on during my spare time. From the <strong>Early Access</strong> launch in June 2019, to the <strong>Full Release</strong> in April 2023, and now the <strong>\u201cReloaded\u201d</strong> update, this project has definitely come a long way in the past 8 years. Being able to work full-time on this passion project is something I never take for granted, and it\u2019s all thanks to the amazing feedback and support from this community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My goal is to continue making more fun VR content for people to enjoy!<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to check out the official Fast and Low discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f7f77ec2c5c9265c8287f629171b99b5b84585f0.jpg","localized_name":"Locked and Loaded","name":"Locked and Loaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/f7f77ec2c5c9265c8287f629171b99b5b84585f0.jpg"},{"icon":"f2213a28bc116867ed1da67f26821a2f83d507f4.jpg","localized_name":"Pistol Lover","name":"Pistol Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/f2213a28bc116867ed1da67f26821a2f83d507f4.jpg"},{"icon":"9a441b5ce00f3ecb48d3985cab8e7413f9d8492a.jpg","localized_name":"SMG Enthusiast","name":"SMG Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/9a441b5ce00f3ecb48d3985cab8e7413f9d8492a.jpg"},{"icon":"53b32eba5f11709f729854929970e6779970f369.jpg","localized_name":"Rifle Fanatic","name":"Rifle Fanatic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/53b32eba5f11709f729854929970e6779970f369.jpg"},{"icon":"4f2893a6ced00b3b003178e2bdf7a1fa8446d88b.jpg","localized_name":"Boomstick Enjoyer","name":"Boomstick Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/4f2893a6ced00b3b003178e2bdf7a1fa8446d88b.jpg"},{"icon":"00e66974243263ffe5149db8e2cb905fc9e51cda.jpg","localized_name":"Hands in the Air!","name":"Hands in the Air!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/00e66974243263ffe5149db8e2cb905fc9e51cda.jpg"},{"icon":"68e1fe43a3cb1fd97263ebef18ebb9065fafc771.jpg","localized_name":"Full Custody","name":"Full Custody","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/68e1fe43a3cb1fd97263ebef18ebb9065fafc771.jpg"},{"icon":"97fc83d956ef76d71657483c4ba105e614b5a0ec.jpg","localized_name":"Non-Lethal Specialist","name":"Non-Lethal Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/97fc83d956ef76d71657483c4ba105e614b5a0ec.jpg"},{"icon":"6a901dbc07a95307b5b74585d3b33c501f9354b4.jpg","localized_name":"Lethal Force Authorized","name":"Lethal Force Authorized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/6a901dbc07a95307b5b74585d3b33c501f9354b4.jpg"},{"icon":"9ccab6a019167752b148734520f7a7519ca7fcd7.jpg","localized_name":"Street Enforcer","name":"Street Enforcer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097620/9ccab6a019167752b148734520f7a7519ca7fcd7.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1097620?t=1775801091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/776d7a1a9b62493baa74d110a2a0a9d8bfef676f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775801091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/3feeee647687aabedcebf0396d6ead36d59732d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775801091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/3feeee647687aabedcebf0396d6ead36d59732d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775801091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoon violence, Blood and Gore, Mild Language"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city under fire, it\u2019s up to Officer Faust and Officer Lo to clean up the streets. Play as Faust or Lo, or the rest of the police force, to breach-and-clear your way through over 23 hand-crafted missions as you are tasked with neutralizing hostile threats and rescuing civilians.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/e3c8a7738e33cc2985a1b505e447a132.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=988 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/e3c8a7738e33cc2985a1b505e447a132.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/e3c8a7738e33cc2985a1b505e447a132.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFast and Low\u201d is a violent and intense tactical shooter that is depicted within a colorful and cartoonish setting.  One of the <strong>key</strong> features of \u201cFast and Low\u201d is that it can be played both in VR, or entirely using traditional FPS mouse/keyboard controls. Whereas the VR player will be able to physically peek around corners, and blind-fire from safety, FPS players are in turn given a wider array of tools and equipment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/4b65aa16656efde3f8d21880eade0034.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=988 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/4b65aa16656efde3f8d21880eade0034.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/4b65aa16656efde3f8d21880eade0034.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can play through the missions <strong>Solo</strong> (with an AI partner), <strong>Local Asymmetric Multiplayer</strong> (1 VR Player + 1 FPS Player on the <u>same </u>PC), or engage in up to 4-player <strong>Online Multiplayer Co-op</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/76652bd21c5ddd01ee3b5fc35dc53042.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=1008 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/76652bd21c5ddd01ee3b5fc35dc53042.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/76652bd21c5ddd01ee3b5fc35dc53042.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and Low features location-based damage for both hostiles and civilians. Shoot a hostile in the arm to disarm them, or target their legs to cripple them\u2014making them far more likely to surrender!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/8c864f080a410182f4cbd4f697791a6b.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=1008 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/8c864f080a410182f4cbd4f697791a6b.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/8c864f080a410182f4cbd4f697791a6b.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Built from the ground up for room-scale Virtual Reality. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local Asymmetric Multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online Multiplayer for up to 4 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game offers multiple forms of <strong>Free-locomotion</strong> (arm-swinging or touch-pad locomotion) and <strong>Snap/Smooth</strong> Rotation options, and accessibility options like '<i>Left-handed</i>' modes and <i>Movement Comfort Vignettes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience realistic weapon handling in Fast and Low. Manually chamber rounds, rack slides, and handle each firearm the way they're meant to be used.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/b7edf5d84854598e8ae870db6a1bc482.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/b7edf5d84854598e8ae870db6a1bc482.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/b7edf5d84854598e8ae870db6a1bc482.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Unlockable Weapons,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 Handcrafted levels</strong> to Breach and Clear your way through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomized enemy/civilian spawns to make each deployment feel different!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> A game mode where you can replay unlocked missions and adjust the civilian/enemy density, modify your health pool, or experiment with slow motion in multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>Spectator Camera</strong>\u00a0to share high quality footage with others!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What was the vision for Fast and Low? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vision of Fast and Low was to create a violent, and engaging tactical shooter, set within a colorful cartoonish world.  This was meant to be a difficult game akin to the old-school \u201cSWAT\u201d or \u201cRainbow Six\u201d series. Enemies will be able to kill  players quickly within one or two bursts, but likewise, players can quickly dispatch targets with well-placed headshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon is also carefully crafted with its own unique recoil behaviour, making each firearm feel distinct and satisfying to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/6e600ca1371b88d3280e57db68d5b4b5.poster.avif?t=1775801091\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/6e600ca1371b88d3280e57db68d5b4b5.webm?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/extras/6e600ca1371b88d3280e57db68d5b4b5.mp4?t=1775801091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>One of the <strong>KEY</strong> features of Fast and Low is its ability to allow VR players to play locally with a buddy (via <strong>Asymmetric Multiplayer</strong>) on the same computer. I felt that there weren\u2019t enough games currently in VR that allowed interaction between a VR player and the outside world.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who are the developers?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Just MYSELF! Fast and Low started off as a passion project which I was working on during my spare time. From the <strong>Early Access</strong> launch in June 2019, to the <strong>Full Release</strong> in April 2023, and now the <strong>\u201cReloaded\u201d</strong> update, this project has definitely come a long way in the past 8 years. Being able to work full-time on this passion project is something I never take for granted, and it\u2019s all thanks to the amazing feedback and support from this community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My goal is to continue making more fun VR content for people to enjoy!<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to check out the official Fast and Low discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Urban Giraffe Games Inc."],"dlc":[4513870],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097620/687ad4e298ea24b0a95471195f111b93f783d7e5/header.jpg?t=1775801091","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1097620/515137861/9df9a002feaf6fbd41a4a53bfacb4c2db2b69ba8/1775698193/dash_av1.mpd?t=1775698866","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1097620/515137861/9df9a002feaf6fbd41a4a53bfacb4c2db2b69ba8/1775698193/dash_h264.mpd?t=1775698866","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1097620/515137861/9df9a002feaf6fbd41a4a53bfacb4c2db2b69ba8/1775698193/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=177569886